<section class="page-head ab-open">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a class="link" href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span>About</span></nav>
    <h1 class="ab-title">The things that shape your everyday life, <span class="v">finally understood from the inside.</span></h1>
    <div class="ab-body">
      <p>Hiveworx is a hands-on design school where real practitioners teach through their own lived experience, giving anyone, regardless of background, the tools and confidence to think, make, and see the world differently.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="values">
      <article class="card value">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="17" cy="14" r="6"/><path d="M6 40c1-9 5-14 11-14s10 5 11 14"/><path d="M30 16h12v12H30zM34 28l-3 8M38 28l3 8"/></svg>
        <h3>Practitioners, not professors</h3>
        <p>Our mentors learned through curiosity, practice, mistakes and personal obsession, and they teach the same way they worked.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card value">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 38 30 16l6 6-22 22H8Z"/><path d="m26 20 6 6M34 8l6 6-4 4-6-6Z"/></svg>
        <h3>Learn by doing</h3>
        <p>Talks and lectures give you the story behind the work. Workshops, demonstrations and hands-on experiments let you try it with your own hands.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card value">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 4 42 14v20L24 44 6 34V14Z"/><path d="M17 24h14M24 17v14"/></svg>
        <h3>Open to anyone</h3>
        <p>Everyone is welcome, whatever your age or background. You don’t need previous education, a portfolio or any design experience.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card value">
        <svg class="ico" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 34a12 12 0 1 1 12 0c-2 2-2 4-2 6h-8c0-2 0-4-2-6Z"/><path d="M20 44h8M24 26v-6M20 22l4-4 4 4"/></svg>
        <h3>Try new fields</h3>
        <p>Explore a discipline without long-term commitment. Discover new interests, hobbies or a possible career, and build confidence through doing.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="nots-row">
      <p class="nots-lead hand">what we left out</p>
      <ul class="nots" aria-label="What Hiveworx is not">
        <li><span>Traditional school</span><svg class="x" viewBox="0 0 44 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 5C16 15 28 26 39 35"/><path d="M40 6C30 15 18 26 5 35"/></svg></li>
        <li><span>Diplomas &amp; certificates</span><svg class="x" viewBox="0 0 44 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 5C16 15 28 26 39 35"/><path d="M40 6C30 15 18 26 5 35"/></svg></li>
        <li><span>Academic status</span><svg class="x" viewBox="0 0 44 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 5C16 15 28 26 39 35"/><path d="M40 6C30 15 18 26 5 35"/></svg></li>
        <li><span>Entry requirements</span><svg class="x" viewBox="0 0 44 40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 5C16 15 28 26 39 35"/><path d="M40 6C30 15 18 26 5 35"/></svg></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
